; Cesia_v1, the interface of native packages, and Cesia_link, which loads an engine: a plugin that the binary loads at the
; first call of a native of a package, its code open to the engines. An engine is compiled against cesia_v1.cmi alone, whose
; fingerprint never changes once released: so no alias module (wrapped false), whose fingerprint would follow every module
; added, and -opaque, so that an engine records none of the code behind it.

(library
 (name cesia_native)
 (wrapped false)
 (flags
  (:standard -opaque))
 (libraries cesia cesia_sys))
